      "value": "I replied in discord but I'll add in here for completeness. Currently a spacebar press will also trigger the calibration. There are all kinds of tools out there to arbitrarily trigger a keypress, could even be voice activated, so I think this is the best bet for someone needing to customize exactly how binding in to a calibration is triggered.",
