  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It would be nice if we got an option (and this time a launch option would be fine, I guess) to be able to calibrate by pulling just one trigger - this would be useful for people who only have one controller (somewhat common with how often Index thumbsticks die), or can only use one controller due to a disability or any other reason.\nThis used to be a feature in [redacted], and now that it isn't anymore, people complain.",
